* Tue Jun 17 2025
- Initial beta release
- OpenGL ES renderer with shader pipeline
- Cursor trail effects
- Kitty Graphics Protocol for inline images
- URL auto-detect and tap-to-open
- Multi-session support with session ordering
- Scrollback encryption via Sailfish Secrets
- 39 locale translations with proper plural forms
